<title>USA: Michigan State Housing Authority $86 mln repriced.</title>
<headline>Michigan State Housing Authority $86 mln repriced.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Goldman Sachs &amp; Co said it repriced an $86 million Michigan State Housing Development Authority rental housing revenue bond issue, pricing all bonds at par.</p>
</text>
